WEBVTT

00:08:27.833 --> 00:08:30.643
for how we'll mend and enhance our bodies.

00:08:30.667 --> 00:08:33.018
But I've also smiled at a robot,

00:08:33.042 --> 00:08:35.684
seen a young girl
leap through the air on a blade

00:08:35.708 --> 00:08:38.934
and shaken the hand of a man with no hands

00:08:38.958 --> 00:08:41.518
who towers emotionally above us all.

00:08:41.542 --> 00:08:45.393
I'm left in awe of the complexity
of the human body.

00:08:45.417 --> 00:08:47.934
But I also feel
that it's not just our bodies,

00:08:47.958 --> 00:08:49.309
bionics or not,

00:08:49.333 --> 00:08:50.934
that make us strong,

00:08:50.958 --> 00:08:54.684
but our emotions
and understanding our weaknesses.

00:08:54.708 --> 00:08:57.393
But I'd like to think
of these works as studies,

00:08:57.417 --> 00:08:59.143
something that we can come back to

00:08:59.167 --> 00:09:01.393
and carefully observe.